      "cooked": "<p>While playing and restarting Team Villians game the didn't involve Parse or Kismet, I got the notice for doing the Achievements for both. &nbsp;I didn't get the fanfare in-game, it was my iPad telling me I got the achievements upon restarting my crashed game. &nbsp;I now have access to Fugue Stae Parse and Tricky Kismet. &nbsp;</p><p>See screenshot below. &nbsp;Anyone else getting this?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0899ce8f8174553762327bf6e471767c484f112a.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/0899ce8f8174553762327bf6e471767c484f112a\" title=\"image_38.jpg\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0899ce8f8174553762327bf6e471767c484f112a_2_666x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image_38.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"1e5lFosjclH4iNIzGkBpTKkzH7A\" width=\"666\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0899ce8f8174553762327bf6e471767c484f112a_2_666x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0899ce8f8174553762327bf6e471767c484f112a_2_999x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0899ce8f8174553762327bf6e471767c484f112a.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0899ce8f8174553762327bf6e471767c484f112a_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image_38.jpg</span><span class=\"informations\">1024×768 153 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
